<Slide style={{ padding: '0px' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
  <Box style={{ padding: '26px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>多站数据怎么用：联合训练胜过「预训练 + 微调」</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, height: 258 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.5, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Image src="assets/three_learner.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 242, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>单站从零（基线）</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4A5568' }}>3.941</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>树　预训练 + 微调</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>−0.36%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>6/10</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>XGBoost　预训练 + 微调</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>−11.81%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>5/10</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #C6D7EC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>树　多站联合</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+14.61%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>8/10</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #C6D7EC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>XGBoost　多站联合</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+4.11%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>6/10</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>LSTM　预训练 + 微调</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+18.01%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>7/10</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #C6D7EC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '2px 11px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1 }}>LSTM　多站联合</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>+36.15%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>10/10</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, height: 104, marginTop: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.25, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '13px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>换 XGBoost 复跑：方向一个都没变</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>联合训练都是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>排第一</span>的正收益；随便搬别站模型都是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>最差</span>；微调只在 LSTM 上成立。三种模型，六个数，符号全同。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '13px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>但「能降多少」要实测</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>同为多站联合，两类树模型差 10.5 个百分点（14.61% 对 4.11%）。<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>有效性稳，量级随求解器浮动</span>，别照抄百分比。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, width: '100%', height: 118, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, padding: '12px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
      一句话结论：迁移<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>确实有效</span>（十站平均 MAE：LSTM 3.941 → 3.169 → <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2.374</span>；XGBoost 2.619 → <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2.416</span>，单位 %装机容量），但<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>多站联合比预训练 + 微调更划算</span>。
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#D6E4F7', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
      三种模型上这条都成立，其中两类树模型的「预训练 + 微调」都是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>负收益</span>。
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>11 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
